  "document": "Andrew Lincoln\nAndrew James Clutterbuck (born 14 September 1973), better known by his stage name Andrew Lincoln, is an English actor. He is most recognised for his portrayal of Rick Grimes, the lead character in the AMC post-apocalyptic horror television series—based on the eponymous comic book series of the same name—\"The Walking Dead\". His first major role was in the BBC drama \"This Life\", followed by roles such as Simon Casey in the Channel 4 sitcom \"Teachers\" and Mark in the Christmas-themed romantic comedy film \"Love Actually\" (2003)."
